D d-7b0104 2026-09-30 lab/claude - work src/services/booking-service.ts ->K services.ports Implement cancellation fees in BookingService.cancel(): 10% of booking price if cancelled < 24h before confirmed slot starts; zero otherwise. Staff customers (kind='staff') never pay fees per ops agreement (d-0004). Load customer to check kind; check booking.status === 'confirmed'; compute hours = (startsAt - now) / 3.6e6; charge via percentOf(price, 10) for half-even rounding. Fee travels on booking.cancelled event for downstream billing/reports.
D d-8bcf2b 2026-09-30 lab/claude - work src/services/booking-service.ts#BookingService ->K services.ports Implement waiting list: when a confirmed booking is cancelled, automatically promote the earliest active requested booking for the same slot. BookingService.cancel() now returns {booking, fee, promoted?} where promoted is the id of the confirmed waiting-list booking, or undefined if none was promoted. Promoter: skip suspended customers (d-0005) and find the first requested booking with status=active. Record booking.cancelled event before booking.confirmed event for the promoted booking (d-0006). Tests remain passing; existing callers access .booking field (destructuring is backwards-compatible).
D d-272862 2026-09-30 lab/claude - work src/services/booking-service.ts#BookingService ->K services.ports Add refund field to cancel() return value: calculated as price - fee using subtract() from money module. Refund represents the amount returned to customer after cancellation fee. Existing callers remain compatible by accessing .booking field or destructuring. Tests remain passing.
D d-6ee695 2026-09-30 lab/claude - work src/services/booking-service.ts ->K services.ports Added applyDiscount(bookingId, code) method that applies a discount code percentage to a booking's price, respecting the minimum price floor (d-0007). Uses percentOf for correct half-even rounding (d-0001). Injected DiscountRepository port into constructor. Method loads booking, validates discount code exists, loads slot, calculates discounted price with percentOf, and ensures price doesn't drop below slot's minimumPrice. Saves and returns updated booking."
D d-f395c8 2026-09-30 lab/claude - work src/app.ts ->K app.composition Added MemoryDiscountRepository instantiation and injection into BookingService. Discount adapter is constructed only in app.ts per composition root constraint (G:app.composition). Returns discounts adapter as `discounts` property on app object, allowing callers to save discount codes."
D d-f85ded 2026-09-30 lab/claude - work src/api/http.ts#createHttp ->C client-contract Added POST /bookings/:id/cancel route that calls BookingService.cancel(id) and returns 202 Accepted with { booking, fee, refund, promoted } in response body. Status 202 signals asynchronous refund settlement per decision d-0008; clients poll the booking for final state. Response shape maps BookingService.cancel() return value directly.
D d-535d5f 2026-09-30 lab/claude - work src/services/booking-service.ts ->K services.ports Added 3-booking limit validation in request() method: customer may hold at most 3 active bookings (status requested or confirmed). Before creating a new booking, listByCustomer() is called and filtered with isActive() helper. If count >= 3, throws DomainError('LIMIT'). Preserves all existing constraints: status changes via transition(), events recorded, percentOf for amounts, and services depend on ports not adapters. All 18 tests passing.
